  "limits": [
    "Semantic colors cover modern Hangul syllables and compatibility jamo; 51 original halfwidth Hangul aliases share the colored jamo glyphs. Latin, digits and punctuation retain ordinary foreground color. Supported static weights: 100 through 900 in steps of 100.",
    "Original glyph data and placement metrics are preserved; color rasterization is not guaranteed pixel-identical to monochrome rendering.",
    "Opaque colors are assumed for continuous-stroke junction ownership."
  ],
